459
00:28:35.120 --> 00:28:36.800
Oh. OK.

460
00:28:36.800 --> 00:28:37.960
Thank you.

461
00:28:39.200 --> 00:28:40.240
Thank you.

462
00:28:41.520 --> 00:28:44.480
That's... Yeah.
